      ],
      "updated": 1783201633027,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "i) immediate before/after timestamp :-\n   Binary search on version,  O(logn) time.\n\nii) from timestamp t1 to t2 :-\nBinarys earch to find t1, then traverse from t1 to t2\nO(logn + k) time ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "i) immediate before/after timestamp :-\n   Binary search on version,  O(logn) time.\n\nii) from timestamp t1 to t2 :-\nBinarys earch to find t1, then traverse from t1 to t2\nO(logn + k) time ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
