      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "RAM ONLY!!!!!\n\nIndexes maintained in RAM.\nPeriodic checkpoints written to disk.\n\n      Startup:\n           Load checkpoint.\n           Replay missed records.\n           Rebuild indexes.",
