      "updated": 1783201633028,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WHAT IF HARD DRIVE FULL??\n\nComapction :- \n\nForget old data periodically, or let user have \ncustom query to create comapaction.\nAs well as delete garbage collection.\nExtend storage if required.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "WHAT IF HARD DRIVE FULL??\n\nComapction :- \n\nForget old data periodically, or let user have \ncustom query to create comapaction.\nAs well as delete garbage collection.\nExtend storage if required.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
